%
****calcul 
  ***mesh plane_strain
  **file ../mesh_test.geof

  ***resolution
  **sequence 
  *time        0.9999 1.  10. 30.  365. 730.  1095. 1825. 3650. %here the simulation is made over 10 years = 365*10
   *iteration 10
   *ratio    1.e-2
   *algorithm p1p2p3
  **automatic_time  epcum 0.001 eicum 0.001
   *divergence 2.0 4
   *security   1.2

   *first_dtime 0.9999  1.e-4  1.  1.  30.  30.  60. 120. 365.
   *max_dtime   0.9999  1.e-4 10. 10.  30.  30.  60. 120. 365.
 
 ***output
   **frequency
    *dtime 30. 
   **output_first                
   **node
   **no_reaction
   **component epcum sig11 sig22 sig33 sig12 sig::mises eto


 ***bc
  **impose_nodal_dof 
    %fixed bottom and lateral faces
    EAST    U1 0. 
    EAST    U2 0. 
    WEST    U1 0. 
    WEST    U2 0.   
    BOTTOM  U1 0.
    BOTTOM  U2 0.
    
 % **simili_gravity
 %  *nset EARTH_SURFACE
 %  *factor 29430.  % rho*g = 3000*9.81 (time disapear from equation, not needed to convert m/s-2 in m/j-2 %3.0 density of the lithosphere
 %  *origin (0. 0. 0.)

  ***equation 
   **earthquake
    fault_plane_B  U1    
    fault_plane_A  U1
   *translation ascii_file ../disp_U1.dat T_EQ

   **earthquake
    fault_plane_B  U2  
    fault_plane_A  U2       
   *translation ascii_file ../disp_U2.dat T_EQ

 ***table
  **name CONSTANT
   *time 0.  1.e+30
   *value 1. 1.
  **name T_EQ
   *time  0. 0.9999 1. 1.e30 % the earthquake last 1 minute
   *value 0. 0.     1. 1. 


 ***parameter
  **function profondeur_m   % Par convention, je la prends negative
   *function y; 
   *tables CONSTANT
  **function profondeur_km  % Par convention, je la prends negative
   *function y/1000.; 
   *tables CONSTANT

  ***material 
  
   **elset LITHO-CONTI *file ../lithosphere.mat
   **elset LITHO-OCEAN *file ../lithosphere.mat
   **elset SLAB *file ../lithosphere.mat

   **elset ASTHENO-1-CONTI *file ../burgers_S=1.mat
   **elset ASTHENO-2-CONTI *file ../burgers_S=1.mat

   **elset ASTHENO-1-OCEAN *file ../burgers_S=1.mat
   **elset ASTHENO-2-OCEAN *file ../burgers_S=1.mat
   
   **elset MANTLE  *file ../lithosphere.mat
   
****return
